{"page":516,"width":1726,"height":2544,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"Part 6","words":[{"text":"Part","x":582,"y":512,"width":127,"height":53},{"text":"6","x":731,"y":516,"width":34,"height":49}]},{"text":"F/7e 芦/″","words":[{"text":"F/7e","x":189,"y":766,"width":137,"height":70},{"text":"芦/″","x":382,"y":786,"width":217,"height":82}]},{"text":"파일은 작성자가 정의한 연관된 정보의 모음이다. 파일은 운영체제에서 물리적 대용량 저장장","words":[{"text":"파일은","x":309,"y":979,"width":95,"height":33},{"text":"작성자가","x":417,"y":982,"width":122,"height":34},{"text":"정의한","x":551,"y":984,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"연관된","x":651,"y":986,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"정보의","x":747,"y":987,"width":84,"height":33},{"text":"모음이다.","x":842,"y":986,"width":120,"height":32},{"text":"파일은","x":977,"y":987,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"운영체제에서","x":1074,"y":986,"width":172,"height":33},{"text":"물리적","x":1259,"y":986,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"대용량","x":1361,"y":985,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"저장장","x":1459,"y":985,"width":88,"height":32}]},{"text":"치로 매핑된다. 파일 시스템은 파일이 물리적 장치에 매핑되는 방법과 사용자와 프로그램이 파","words":[{"text":"치로","x":309,"y":1034,"width":63,"height":33},{"text":"매핑된다.","x":385,"y":1036,"width":128,"height":34},{"text":"파일","x":528,"y":1039,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"시스템은","x":597,"y":1040,"width":115,"height":33},{"text":"파일이","x":722,"y":1041,"width":84,"height":33},{"text":"물리적","x":817,"y":1040,"width":85,"height":33},{"text":"장치에","x":914,"y":1040,"width":84,"height":33},{"text":"매핑되는","x":1012,"y":1041,"width":114,"height":33},{"text":"방법과","x":1137,"y":1040,"width":86,"height":34},{"text":"사용자와","x":1232,"y":1041,"width":118,"height":33},{"text":"프로그램이","x":1360,"y":1039,"width":144,"height":32},{"text":"파","x":1517,"y":1039,"width":29,"height":32}]},{"text":"일을 액세스하고 조작하는 방법을 설명한다.","words":[{"text":"일을","x":310,"y":1089,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"액세스하고","x":383,"y":1092,"width":154,"height":34},{"text":"조작하는","x":547,"y":1095,"width":117,"height":33},{"text":"방법을","x":675,"y":1096,"width":84,"height":33},{"text":"설명한다.","x":769,"y":1095,"width":121,"height":34}]},{"text":"물리적 저장장치에 대한 액세스 속도가 느릴 수 있으므로 효율적인 액세스를 목표로 파일","words":[{"text":"물리적","x":373,"y":1147,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"저장장치에","x":478,"y":1149,"width":146,"height":34},{"text":"대한","x":639,"y":1151,"width":56,"height":32},{"text":"액세스","x":705,"y":1150,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"속도가","x":802,"y":1150,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"느릴","x":899,"y":1151,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"수","x":968,"y":1152,"width":30,"height":32},{"text":"있으므로","x":1010,"y":1151,"width":114,"height":32},{"text":"효율적인","x":1134,"y":1149,"width":114,"height":33},{"text":"액세스를","x":1261,"y":1149,"width":117,"height":33},{"text":"목표로","x":1389,"y":1149,"width":89,"height":31},{"text":"파일","x":1489,"y":1148,"width":57,"height":33}]},{"text":"시스템을 설계해야 한다. 파일 공유 및 파일에 대한 원격 액세스 지원을 포함하여 다른 요구 사","words":[{"text":"시스템을","x":311,"y":1201,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"설계해야","x":447,"y":1204,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"한다.","x":578,"y":1206,"width":63,"height":33},{"text":"파일","x":655,"y":1206,"width":55,"height":33},{"text":"공유","x":721,"y":1206,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"및","x":790,"y":1206,"width":26,"height":32},{"text":"파일에","x":827,"y":1205,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"대한","x":927,"y":1206,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"원격","x":994,"y":1207,"width":55,"height":33},{"text":"액세스","x":1061,"y":1206,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"지원을","x":1158,"y":1204,"width":85,"height":33},{"text":"포함하여","x":1252,"y":1203,"width":116,"height":33},{"text":"다른","x":1382,"y":1203,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"요구","x":1449,"y":1205,"width":59,"height":31},{"text":"사","x":1518,"y":1205,"width":31,"height":32}]},{"text":"항도 중요할 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"항도","x":313,"y":1256,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"중요할","x":385,"y":1260,"width":94,"height":33},{"text":"수","x":488,"y":1261,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":530,"y":1262,"width":65,"height":33}]}]}